ntumEncryptionNetwork to ensure the secure transfer and storage of sensitive data across various nodes. Your task is to review recent access logs for potential breaches and verify the integrity of the data encryption processes. Please ensure that everything is functioning correctly and report any anomalies you might find in the encryption settings.<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n",
